  "caption": "Author card with its age; \"1 reply\" quiet; new badge; the inline comment field with its one button.",
  "html": "<div class=\"st-ex\"><div class=\"k st-s panel\"><div class=\"panel\" style=\"height:auto\"><div class=\"pax-rep\"><div class=\"ch\"><span class=\"av-s\">J</span><b>jj</b><span class=\"flex\"></span><span class=\"c-dim\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">40m</span></div><div class=\"body15\">Good catch. The key becomes customer and plan; an upgrade starts a fresh bucket.</div></div><div class=\"pax-said\">1 reply, yours, 40m</div><span class=\"pax-new\">new</span><div class=\"pax-inl\"><div class=\"kit-field foc\"><span class=\"tx\">Round up here, or a client retries a second early.<span class=\"pax-caret\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span><span class=\"ib\"><svg class=\"i i14\"><use href=\"#lu-send\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"acts\"><span class=\"btn\">Comment</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
 },
